      <Item ItemId=";Text_HttpSource_Error" ItemType="0" PsrId="211" Leaf="true">
        <Str Cat="Text">
          <Val><![CDATA[NuGet requires HTTPS sources. To use an HTTP source, you must explicitly set 'allowInsecureConnections' to true in your NuGet.Config file. Refer to [https://aka.ms/nuget-https-everywhere]5D;(https://aka.ms/nuget-https-everywhere) for more information.]]></Val>
          <Tgt Cat="Text" Stat="Loc" Orig="New">
            <Val><![CDATA[NuGet 需要 HTTPS 源。要使用 HTTP 源，必须在 NuGet.Config 文件中将“allowInsecureConnections”显式设置为 true。有关详细信息，请参阅 [https://aka.ms/nuget-https-everywhere]5D;(https://aka.ms/nuget-https-everywhere)。]]></Val>
          </Tgt>
        </Str>
        <Disp Icon="Str" />
      </Item>
      <Item ItemId=";Text_HttpSource_Warning" ItemType="0" PsrId="211" Leaf="true">
        <Str Cat="Text">
          <Val><![CDATA[HTTP sources are insecure. Consider using HTTPS instead. 'AllowInsecureConnections' is enabled, permitting HTTP access. For more secure options, see [https://aka.ms/nuget-https-everywhere]5D;(https://aka.ms/nuget-https-everywhere).]]></Val>
          <Tgt Cat="Text" Stat="Loc" Orig="New">
            <Val><![CDATA[HTTP 源不安全。请考虑改用 HTTPS。启用了 "AllowInsecureConnections"，允许 HTTP 访问。如需更安全的选项，请参阅 [https://aka.ms/nuget-https-everywhere]5D;(https://aka.ms/nuget-https-everywhere)。]]></Val>
          </Tgt>
          <Prev Cat="Text">
            <Val><![CDATA[You are attempting to add an HTTP source, which is insecure.]]></Val>
          </Prev>
        </Str>
        <Disp Icon="Str" />
      </Item>
